{
  "name": "@dong-victor/dsh-opencodego-usage",
  "description": "opencode Go 套餐余额查看插件（DSH Web GUI）：侧边栏直接显示 rolling(5小时)/weekly(周)/monthly(余额) 三档用量进度条、百分比与重置时间，60s 自动刷新，无需点击；点击打开详情面板（倒计时、状态徽章、端点/密钥信息）；agent 工具 opencode_go_balance 可直接回答套餐用量。密钥与端点复用 DSH 已配置的 llm-deepseek 接线（credentials 服务 + settings），无需二次配置。零构建依赖、纯 JS 即装即用：`dsh plugin --profile web add @dong-victor/dsh-opencodego-usage`。",
  "version": "0.1.2",
  "type": "module",
  "engines": {
    "node": "^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0"
  },
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": "^0.1.0-rc.6"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "jsdom": "^25.0.1"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node test/host-boot.test.mjs && node test/client-smoke.test.mjs",
    "pack": "npm pack"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "plugin",
    "opencode",
    "go",
    "balance",
    "usage",
    "quota"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/dong-victor/dsh-opencodego-usage.git"
  },
  "publishConfig": {
    "access": "public"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "license": "MIT"
}
